                       1      1 ; Investigation 023 transient-entry environment probe.
                       2      2 ; Build: z80asm -fb ENTRY23.ASM
                       3      3 ;
                       4      4 ; Before its first BDOS call the probe records the main/alternate registers,
                       5      5 ; SP, a 16-byte entry-stack window, and all 256 bytes of page zero.  It then
                       6      6 ; queries live drive/user state and opens/reads DMACHK.DAT without calling
                       7      7 ; Function 26.  A successful read into 0080h demonstrates the inherited DMA.
                       8      8
